OL,3,A'It's a big step up': Behind the scenes
OL,4,Aas Netflix hit Dept Q returns to
OL,5,AEdinburgh
OL,6,
OL,7,FWalking onto any TV set is a thrill -
OL,8,Fand having followed Department Q since
OL,9,FJussi Adler Olsen's novels were first
OL,10,Fdeveloped into a Netflix series, the
OL,11,Fchance to visit the sound stages of
OL,12,FEdinburgh's FirstStage Studios was even
OL,13,Fmore thrilling.
OL,15,FThe second season began filming in the
OL,16,FScottish capital in June, and is due to
OL,17,Fcontinue until October.
OL,19,FI was given the chance to go behind the
OL,20,Fscenes and speak to some of those
OL,21,Fbehind the success of Dept Q.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
