OL,3,A'It's a big step up': Behind the scenes
OL,4,Aas Netflix hit Dept Q returns to
OL,5,AEdinburgh
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe set includes maverick detective
OL,8,FCarl Morck's New Town flat. It's four
OL,9,Ftimes the size of any actual property
OL,10,Fso it can accommodate the cameras,
OL,11,Flights and crew, as well as the
OL,12,Fcharacters who are supposed to live
OL,13,Fthere.
